---
// Figma nodes: 14196:27218 (heading, y3863), 14196:14257 (Illustration 1 at
// x380/y4138, 665x600), 14196:27722 (Fibu card, x108/y4161, 312x239),
// 14196:27725 (Grandma card, x1020/y3971, 312x289). Section spans y3863-4738
// (875px tall), 208px below the solution cards. Desktop uses the exact Figma
// absolute offsets inside the 1224px content box; below xl it stacks.
---

<section class="relative z-10 mx-auto mt-[120px] w-full max-w-[1224px] px-4 xl:mt-[208px]">
  <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center gap-10 xl:block xl:h-[875px]">
    <h2
      class="heading-gradient font-pixel mx-auto max-w-[458px] text-center text-[40px] uppercase leading-[0.9] sm:text-[52px] xl:text-[64px]"
    >
      You get two guides. Not just an app.
    </h2>

    <img
      src="/images/guides-illustration.png"
      alt="Fibu the fox waving a flag beside Grandma holding a balloon"
      class="w-full max-w-[500px] xl:absolute xl:left-[272px] xl:top-[275px] xl:w-[665px] xl:max-w-none"
      loading="lazy"
    />

    <div class="guide-card guide-card-fibu xl:absolute xl:left-0 xl:top-[298px]">
      <p class="text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.2px] text-white light:text-[#1c1512]">Fibu</p>
      <p class="font-fira text-[18px] leading-[1.4] text-white light:text-[#3f3f3f]">
        Fibu is the friend who dares you to hit 'start.' Every streak, every level-up, every badge
        that's fibu cheering the loudest.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="guide-card guide-card-grandma xl:absolute xl:right-0 xl:top-[108px]">
      <p class="text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.2px] text-white light:text-[#1c1512]">Grandma</p>
      <p class="font-fira text-[18px] leading-[1.4] text-white light:text-[#3f3f3f]">
        Grandma is the one who reminds you there's no such thing as behind only next. Broke your
        streak? Missed a week? Grandma's not disappointed. She's just glad you're back.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guide-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 312px;
    overflow: clip;
    border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(204, 97, 0, 0.2);
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .guide-card-fibu {
    background-image: var(--guide-grad-fibu);
  }

  .guide-card-grandma {
    background-image: var(--guide-grad-grandma);
  }
</style>
